From 6486ed06dd67951eaae27b7022c9e5047a14c923 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZhangDM-520 <jixianqiang1540@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:14:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(input): Mod double-right-click toggles maximize

A second Mod+right-click on the same window within the double-click
window (300ms, 8px pointer slop) now toggles maximize instead of
starting another resize. The toggle carries a client maximize request's
target selection, so client_maximize picks the column or the edges for a
tiled window exactly like a titlebar double-click, and a floating window
fills the usable area. The first click resizes as always; clicks past
the window stay single resize attempts.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
